<h1>// Operation Bada-Bing &mdash; Command Center<span class="cursor"></span></h1>

<div style="display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin: 6px 0 18px;">
    <span class="stamp">CLASSIFIED</span>
    <span class="stamp eyes-only">EYES ONLY</span>
    <span class="stamp confirmed">ACTIVE INVESTIGATION</span>
</div>

<pre class="ascii">
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|  PRIMARY TARGET ........ SOPRANO, ANTHONY J.  ("TONY")       |
|  ALIAS / MONIKER ....... "T", "THE BOSS"                     |
|  AFFILIATION ........... DiMeo Crime Family / NJ             |
|  RANK .................. BOSS                                |
|  STATUS ................ ACTIVE &middot; UNDER SURVEILLANCE       |
|  LAST KNOWN LOCATION ... <span class="redact">REDACTED REDACTED REDACTED</span>          |
